From 3896dd0187b52cd41c9e6feb3ccddac1765f4c26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 11:43:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 107/140] fix(player): refine audio UI and external display
 projection

Extend the upper visualizer behind the status bar, match ribbon and seekbar colors, and simplify the minimum audio duration slider.

Fix external surface handoff, place notification artwork beside the title with icon-free chapter progress, and restrict Vercel Git deployments to master.
